    "body": "Add script_tests.json and tx_invalid.json vectors for edge cases that\nother implementations have gotten wrong, including CSV with -2, IFDUP\non negative zero, ROLL with duplicate values, a taproot output key\nthat is not a valid x coordinate, and single-flag STRICTENC, LOW_S and\nNULLFAIL cases.\n\nSome policy cases were only caught by the tx_valid harness adding\nflags back, which implementations copying the JSON don't replicate.\n\nRelated: #36455 \n\nThese were discovered by finding gaps in an alternate implementation (bitcoin-s)\n\n",
